Note: the auditable business-logic use case
Function assess takes score, ratio
    If score is at least 720 and ratio is at most 0.36 then
        Return "APPROVED: prime"
    Otherwise If score is at least 640 then
        Return "APPROVED: standard"
    Otherwise
        Return "DECLINED"
    End
End
Say assess(750, 0.30)
Say assess(660, 0.40)
Say assess(500, 0.60)
